      "message": "Let an older contact table hold a pending address, and keep a refusal from spending the hour\n\nThe reference instance refused every new address: its contact table was\nmade when an address was required, and an address is now pending, with\nnone on record, until its link is followed. SQLite cannot relax NOT NULL\nin place, so an older table is rebuilt in the current shape at open with\nits rows and index carried over. The same attempt also spent the hourly\nconfirmation slot before anything was sent, so the second try said to\nwait; a refused address now gives the slot back.\n\nChange-Id: Icontact0093pending\nSigned-off-by: Mandip Adhikari <92096340+mandipadk@users.noreply.github.com>",
